  "answer": "I couldn't find a past ticket reporting this same problem, where an auto-update set to the Stable channel installed a Preview release. The archived auto-update tickets (#38495, #10589, #15990) cover different issues such as updates failing to install, new versions not being detected, or a hidden 'Check for updates' button. Others (#43556, #48022) have no usable details. This looks like a new report. Please keep the bug report ZIP attached to the ticket and note the exact versions (0.101.2362.0 to 0.101.2373.0). Until it's investigated, you can install the latest stable release manually from the PowerToys GitHub releases page and check that the update channel setting in PowerToys is still set to Stable."
